 accomplishment of goals and objectives.</p><p style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                </span>- Hires, trains, coaches and counsels, evaluates individual performance, and makes recommendations concerning retention,<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">                   </span>promotion, and termination.<span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal"><span style="xfa-tab-count:2">                  </span></span></p></body>
